    "chunk_text": "\u00f0a\u00f0 ge, ne hie nawer deria\u00f0. Gif ge \u00feonne elles do\u00f0, hie cleopia\u00f0 to me, & ic gehiere hie & ic eow \u00feonne slea mid minum sweorde Gif \u00f0u fioh to borge selle \u00feinum geferan, \u00fee mid \u00fee eardian wille, ne niede \u00f0u hine swa swa niedling & Gif mon n\u00e6bbe buton anfeald hr\u00e6gl hine mid to wreonne & to werianne, & he hit to wedde selle, \u00e6r Gif \u00f0u swa ne dest, \u00feonne cleopa\u00f0 he to me, & ic hine gehiere, for\u00f0on \u00f0e ic eom swi\u00f0e mildheort. Ne t\u00e6l \u00f0u \u00f0inne Dryhten, ne \u00f0one hlaford \u00fe\u00e6s folces ne werge \u00feu. \u00deine teo\u00f0an sceattas & \u00feine frumripan gongendes & weaxendes agif \u00feu Gode. Eal \u00f0\u00e6t fl\u00e6sc \u00fe\u00e6t wildeor l\u00e6fen ne eten ge \u00fe\u00e6t, ac sella\u00f0 hit hundum. Leases monnes word ne rec \u00f0u no \u00fe\u00e6s to gehieranne, ne his domas ne ge\u00f0afa \u00f0u, ne nane gewitnesse Ne wend \u00f0u \u00f0e no on \u00fe\u00e6s folces unr\u00e6d & unryht gewill on hiora spr\u00e6ce & geclysp ofer \u00f0in ryht, & \u00f0\u00e6s Gif \u00f0e becume o\u00f0res mannes giemeleas fioh on hond \u00feeah hit sie \u00f0in feond, gecy\u00f0e hit him. Dem \u00f0u swi\u00f0e emne. Ne dem \u00f0u o\u00f0erne dom \u00feam welegan, o\u00f0erne \u00f0am earman; ne o\u00f0erne \u00feam liofran & o\u00f0erne \u00feam la\u00f0ran Onscuna \u00f0u a leasunga. So\u00f0f\u00e6stne man & unscyldigne ne acwele \ufffd",
